            <ArticleTitle>Evaluation of large-scale clinical trials on cardiovascular disease risk in patients with type 2 diabetes mellitus treated with dipeptidyl peptidase 4 inhibitors and a new class of drugs.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>633-634</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
